<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="computer.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="computer">
    <!-- Tier 2 screen #5 (computer_session::use). The computer terminal output
         pane: one line per entry in the `lines` buffer (print_* appends them),
         indent → left padding, colour via cata_text_to_rml (untagged text falls
         back to the terminal-green default, matching the legacy c_green base; red
         errors / yellow gibberish carry their own spans). This doc is a
         persistent BACKDROP — the root menu (uilist) and prompts (query_*) are
         already migrated (Tier 0) and render over it. Non-interactive: input is
         entirely on those menus/prompts. -->
    <div class="panel comp-panel">
        <div class="comp-screen scroll-pane">
            <div class="comp-line" data-for="ln : lines"
                 data-class-indent="ln.indented" data-rml="ln.text_rml"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
